{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんメリークリスマス。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イヴは一人で久しぶりに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下妻物語と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デトロイトメタルシティ観て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑っていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな映画です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、夜にはチキンを食べました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はあーチキン美味ー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/25/7867997/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嗚呼ー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/25/7867997/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお仕事があった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふははははーーーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/25/0001.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事終わりに3人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスディナーして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイーツ食べちゃったりして。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったりまったりしてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆ、ひめかありがとうー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/25/7867997/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木